  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Hei Fan’s true inheritance, the immortal killer move Bountiful Year is described as not created by Hei Fan. Hei Fan exchanged for it with a person called Pill Immortal. The move uses immortal level year Gu as its core with tens of thousands of supplementary mortal Gu, takes two or three days for Hei Fan to prepare, and raises resource production inside the immortal aperture for the next year after activation.",
      "chapters": [
        1130
      ],
