    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan prepares Bountiful Year from Hei Fan’s true inheritance, the narration repeats that Hei Fan did not create it and had traded for it with a Gu Immortal great expert named Pill Immortal. Pill Immortal created the move, and Hei Fan exchanged other resources for it.",
